Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:08.67,Title7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)}Perfect\N{\fs84\fsp6\b0}Ed Sheeran • Pink Edition (Slowed + Reverb)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:14.10,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I found a love for me,\Ndarling, just dive right in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:19.08,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,510)\fad(200,150)}and follow my lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:28.32,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Well, I found a girl,\Nbeautiful and sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:36.42,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Oh, I never knew you were the someone\Nwaiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:46.47,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}'Cause we were just kids\Nwhen we fell in love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:54.91,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Not knowing what it was,\NI will not give you up this time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:01:03.58,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Darling, just kiss me slow,\Nyour heart is all I own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:11.91,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}And in your eyes,\Nyou're holding mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:19.77,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\Nwith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:29.02,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Barefoot on the grass,\Nlistening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:36.53,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}When you said you looked a mess,\NI whispered underneath my breath
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:49.83,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}But you heard it, darling,\Nyou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:55.61,Title7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)}Perfect\N{\fs84\fsp6\b0}Ed Sheeran • Pink Edition (Slowed + Reverb)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:02:04.28,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Well, I found a woman,\Nstronger than anyone I know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:12.72,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}She shares my dreams,\NI hope that someday I'll share her home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:18.15,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I found a lover,\Nto carry more than just my secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:23.35,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}To carry love,\Nto carry children of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:34.34,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}We are still kids, but we're so in love\NFighting against all odds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:42.43,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,510)\fad(200,150)}I know we'll be alright this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:50.52,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Darling, just hold my hand,\Nbe my girl, I'll be your man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:59.77,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,510)\fad(200,150)}I see my future in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:08.44,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\Nwith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:17.69,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Barefoot on the grass,\Nlistening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:25.20,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}When I saw you in that dress,\Nlooking so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:36.76,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I don't deserve this, darling,\Nyou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:50.64,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\Nwith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:58.73,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}Barefoot on the grass,\Nlistening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:07.98,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}I have faith in what I see,\Nnow I know I have met an angel in person
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:19.54,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)}And she looks perfect,\NI don't deserve this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:35.14,Lyric7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,510)\fad(200,150)}You look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:05:02.89,Title7Clouds,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)}Perfect\N{\fs84\fsp6\b0}Ed Sheeran • Pink Edition (Slowed + Reverb)
